{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> is a fast-paced ultraviolent elemental FPS set in a unique world where the entirety of history has been re-written. Rip your way through augmented humans, monsters, and demons to tear apart an evil cult that controls the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.poster.avif?t=1756996450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.webm?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.mp4?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>four elements</strong> in unique ways to brutally kill enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities together to form even stronger abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANIPULATE </strong>abilities mid-flight to make them more powerful and gain fine control over their movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies in <strong>complex </strong>or <strong>stylish </strong>ways to temporarily increase your brain power, granting access to even more powerful abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely in any direction, both inside and outside of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies by soaring above them with <strong>Flame Propulsion</strong>, or quickly evade attacks by <strong>Dashing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the four elements for additional unique movement abilities as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> has a detailed multi-layered story set in a dark fantasy world where the entirety of planet Earth got Isekai'd. The story is told through dialogue, hidden books, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.poster.avif?t=1756996450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.webm?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.mp4?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920290?t=1756996450","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2920290?t=1756996450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/8aff94993dae31f2479b4d209c83ef9c8a996fd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756996450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/8aff94993dae31f2479b4d209c83ef9c8a996fd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756996450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood and Gore, Intense Violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> is a fast-paced ultraviolent elemental FPS set in a unique world where the entirety of history has been re-written. Rip your way through augmented humans, monsters, and demons to tear apart an evil cult that controls the entire world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.poster.avif?t=1756996450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.webm?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/249d54db5a9e3ee8da834c471a9a4eb8.mp4?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>four elements</strong> in unique ways to brutally kill enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities together to form even stronger abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANIPULATE </strong>abilities mid-flight to make them more powerful and gain fine control over their movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies in <strong>complex </strong>or <strong>stylish </strong>ways to temporarily increase your brain power, granting access to even more powerful abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOVEMENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move freely in any direction, both inside and outside of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid enemies by soaring above them with <strong>Flame Propulsion</strong>, or quickly evade attacks by <strong>Dashing</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the four elements for additional unique movement abilities as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VERSEBREAK</strong> has a detailed multi-layered story set in a dark fantasy world where the entirety of planet Earth got Isekai'd. The story is told through dialogue, hidden books, and environmental storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.poster.avif?t=1756996450\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.webm?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/extras/39821586e7f58cef1ed5a0bd14669496.mp4?t=1756996450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["DYZANTINE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2920290/header.jpg?t=1756996450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2920290/746694/cbf7d6fc3c9dd4585ffab042ed7f86cb446c12ff/1750889059/dash_av1.mpd?t=1724876545","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2920290/746694/cbf7d6fc3c9dd4585ffab042ed7f86cb446c12ff/1750889059/dash_h264.mpd?t=1724876545","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://vi